      "dcterms:title": "Extract selected ontology and SHACL terms into Knop-managed resources",
      "dcterms:description": "Runs extract from the fixture workspace root with mesh root docs. The selected term Knops get metadata and inventory support artifacts with ExtractionSource bindings that track the current ontology or SHACL source artifact and record the observed located file digest. The authored source bytes, mesh config, and generated pages remain unchanged until the following weave step.",
